              font-size: 24px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 500;
              margin-top: 2px !important;
              margin: 0;
            "
          >
            Executive AI edge
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-spacer height="0px" />
        <mj-image
          border-radius="10px"
          padding="10px 12px 4px 12px"
          width="600px"
          src="https://www.dubaisummary.com/email/ad/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
          alt="REPLACE_ME"
        />
        <mj-text
          padding="10px 12px 0px 12px"
          font-family="Arial"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px 0">
            <strong>What's happening?</strong> The Deep View is a free,
            five-minute daily AI newsletter. It distills the most important
            developments in artificial intelligence into concise, actionable
            insights. It covers major breakthroughs, policy shifts, and how
            companies like Google and Meta are applying AI to transform
            business.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px 0">
            <strong>About the company:</strong> The Deep View is a daily AI
            newsletter serving 750,000+ readers across companies like Google,
            Meta, Microsoft, and Andreessen Horowitz (a16z). It delivers clear,
            in-depth analysis on AI’s real-world impact while maintaining strict
            editorial independence and transparent brand partnerships.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0">
            <strong>Advantages:</strong> An AI newsletter filters noise, tracks
            policy and product shifts, highlights competitive moves, and
            translates technical breakthroughs into business impact. This will
            help decision-makers stay informed without constant monitoring of
            fragmented sources.
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
          padding="10px 12px 8px 12px"
          font-family="Arial"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0">
            <a
              style="
                text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #102341;
                color: black;
              "
              ><strong>Learn more</strong></a
            >
          </p>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-spacer height="12px" />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-raw> </a> </mj-raw>
