<strong>Hai Ramadan</strong>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;">Indulge in Dubai’s flagship Ramadan experience at the Al Wasl Plaza, Expo City Dubai. Enjoy a month-long celebration that beautifully blends tradition, community, and contemporary culture.</p>

<p style="margin:0;line-height:24px;font-size:16px;"><a target="_blank" href="https://dubai.platinumlist.net/event-tickets/hai-ramadan" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">09 Mar - Sun 15 Mar, Tickets start from 42.51 USD</a></p>

