        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><a href="https://www.joescafedubai.com/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Joe’s Café</a></strong> Dubai is a stylish café in Fashion Avenue known for premium ingredients, specialty coffee, and a diverse all-day dining menu. Inspired by its London heritage, the venue blends elegant interiors with a cosmopolitan vibe and views of Downtown Dubai. Menu highlights include risotto, gourmet burgers, pancakes, and eggs Benedict, alongside fresh salads, seafood starters, and artisan coffee drinks.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><em>Pro tip:</em></strong><em> Pair terrace dining with fountain show timings for an unforgettable experience.</em></p>
        </mj-text>
