<!-- Summary / CTA -->
<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">GBH Media Company in the UAE is looking to hire a<strong> Digital Marketing Manager</strong> to lead its online campaigns and growth initiatives. The role involves developing digital strategies, managing social media platforms, running paid advertising and <strong>SEO campaigns</strong>, creating content, and overseeing email and website marketing. Candidates should have experience in<strong> digital marketing, analytics, and campaign management</strong>. Background in media, events, or real estate marketing is an advantage.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/marketing-advertising/digital-social-media-marketing/2026/3/10/digital-marketing-manger-2-068---ff30d4d7c1854679adc7b4fdd8dd5200/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here </strong></a><strong> </strong></p>
</mj-text>
