          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dubai aims to eliminate landfill sites by 2041 through waste-to-energy projects. The Warsan Waste-to-Energy Centre has already processed over 4.5mn tonnes of waste, diverting about 62% from landfills while generating clean electricity.</p>
